Mission Control is a real-time orbital intelligence dashboard I built today
to combine my interests in spaceflight, aerospace engineering, planetary
defense systems, and cinematic interface design. The project pulls live data
from NASA and other public APIs to create an immersive command-center
experience inspired by real mission operations systems.
</p>

