The dashboard visualizes live asteroid tracking, ISS telemetry,
satellite activity, earthquakes, Mars weather, and upcoming rocket launches
through a futuristic planetary defense interface. I designed it to feel like
a real aerospace monitoring system while also functioning as a practical way
to keep up with my space hobbies and interests every day.
</p>

